# Design Document: InnoGen Research Workspace

## 1. System Architecture Diagram

```
+-------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|                  InnoGen Research Workspace (Frontend)                  |
|  [Query Console] [Live LangGraph Nodes] [Evidence Matrix] [Report View] |
+------------------------------------+------------------------------------+
                                     | REST & WebSocket APIs
+------------------------------------v------------------------------------+
|                    Node.js / Express API Gateway                        |
|   - /api/v1/research/submit           - /ws/agent (Live Stream)         |
|   - /api/v1/research/:jobId           - /api/v1/research/:jobId/report |
+------------------+------------------------------------+-----------------+
                   |                                    |
                   v                                    v
+------------------------------------+    +-------------------------------+
|  LangGraph Agent Workflow Engine   |    | Prisma Database Service       |
|  1. Planner -> 2. Decomposer       |    | - ResearchJobs & Tasks        |
|  3. Parallel Research Workers      |    | - EvidenceItems & Claims      |
|  4. Evidence -> 5. Claim Extraction|    | - Citations & Contradictions  |
|  6. Citation -> 7. Fact Verify     |    | - Reports & AuditLogs         |
|  8. Contradiction -> 9. Support    |    +-------------------------------+
|  10. Consensus & Confidence        |                    |
+------------------+-----------------+                    v
                   |                         [SQLite / PostgreSQL]
                   v
+------------------------------------+
|  External Research Services        |
|  - Tavily Search API / Web Reader  |
|  - LLM Inference Engine            |
+------------------------------------+
```

## 2. Database Entities
- **ResearchJob**: `id`, `query`, `depth`, `academicOnly`, `status`, `confidenceScore`, `hallucinationScore`, `createdAt`.
- **TaskNode**: `id`, `jobId`, `objective`, `status`.
- **EvidenceItem**: `id`, `jobId`, `taskId`, `sourceUrl`, `sourceTitle`, `publisher`, `snippet`, `domainAuthorityScore`.
- **Claim**: `id`, `jobId`, `claimText`, `status` (VERIFIED / PARTIALLY_VERIFIED / CONTRADICTED / UNSUPPORTED), `confidenceScore`.
- **Citation**: `id`, `claimId`, `url`, `title`, `publisher`, `isValid`, `supportsClaim`.
- **Contradiction**: `id`, `jobId`, `claimText`, `sourceA`, `sourceB`, `explanation`.
- **VerificationReport**: `id`, `jobId`, `summaryMarkdown`, `confidenceScore`, `auditTrailJson`.
